        "subheading": "Flexible licensing: pay by the month while a project runs, or buy it once and keep it.",
        "trial_blurb": "The same application you would buy.",
        "trial_features": "Every feature, no restrictions\nmacOS and Windows\nNo account or credit card needed",
        "trial_cta_text": "Try free for 14 days",
