        "subscription_blurb": "Handy for a single project, or for a longer look at toneScan than the trial allows.",
        "subscription_features": "Every feature, always current\nNew releases as they ship\nTwo machines per licence\nCancel whenever you like",
        "perpetual_blurb": "Buy it once and keep it.",
        "perpetual_features": "Yours to keep, no subscription\nFree updates within a major version\nTwo machines per licence",
        "demo_title": "What you can do without a licence",
